  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving the capacity and competitiveness of farmers in Morelos and Guerrero</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Smallholder farmers in the Mexican states of Morelos and Guerrero often have insufficient income to sustain their families. Unicam-Sur collaborates with farmer organizations in Morelos and Guerrero to improve their organizational capacity and their members&apos; sustainable agricultural practices and access to markets particularly organic and alternative markets known as tianguis. At the IAF we support community-led solutions to expand economic opportunity in Mexico. Unicam-Sur&apos;s activities support smallholder agriculture food production and market access to enhance food security and ensure meaningful opportunities for communities to thrive.</narrative>
  </description>
